Please note that the Debug namespace must be included in order for Debug.Assert to work. 

This assert statement states that 'index' cannot be a negative number as per the comment "@@@ index value is greater than or equal to 0". In C#, boolean assertion condition must be provided inside Debug.Assert() for the assertion to run.
